  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "The All Seasons Collection 30A is pleased to offer this stunning home as part of our distinctive collection of homes exclusively located in the town of Rosemary Beach.<br>This meticulously maintained coastal chic home with an open airy ambiance is the perfect place to enjoy spending time with family and friends. The first floor living area defines comfort, with overstuffed seating, modern \"state of the art\" kitchen with Viking appliances, and a Restoration Hardware style dining area. No detail was overlooked in the design of this space.<br>Also in the first floor, large master suite to include California king bed, walk-in closet and an adjoining en suite with double vanity sinks, and glass enclosed shower. For your convenience a half bath is available as well. <br>In addition to the expansive interior first floor design, floor to ceiling glass windows and French doors opening to the spacious and serene outdoor courtyard featuring a dining/seating area, natural gas grill, shower and lovely water fountain features. Another area to relax and enjoy.<br>On the second level there is another beautiful master suite with vaulted ceilings, California king bed, adjoining en suite with double vanity sinks, glass enclosed shower and larger closets. Directly off the master is an outdoor balcony with seating overlooking the courtyard.<br>The third king bedded master also has an adjoining en suite with a shower/tub combination ample closet space and a lovely walk out balcony with additional seating. The fourth bedroom, great for the kiddo's is a four bed bunk room with adjoining en suite, double vanity sinks and walk-in shower.<br>Also featured on this floor is a cozy and comfortable seating area, great for watching TV or relaxing in this sun filled space reading your favorite novel.<br>All bedrooms are equipped with TV's. <br>During your visit take a stroll down the boardwalk to the famous Butterfly Garden, or relax on the front porch swing facing the private park and goldfish pond. Keeping in mind you are a short walk to the center of town, neighborhood pools and the beautiful sugar white beach. Let this home exceed your expectations as you plan your vacation getaway.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
